{
  "arm": "claudecli_opus5_mcp_plumbline_rejection_selection_v7",
  "contract": "Any awaitable that is consumed during render - passed to use(), thrown to suspend, or stored as a component-visible value that the renderer may unwrap - must itself carry the settled-thenable protocol stamped on the object: a `status` field of 'pending' | 'fulfilled' | 'rejected', with `value` present when fulfilled and `reason` present when rejected. A bare Promise, or an object whose settlement state is tracked in a side channel (a store entry, a match record, a deferred wrapper, an observer field) rather than on the awaitable itself, is no longer a legal pending value; every file that mints, shims, re-wraps or throws such a value must stamp the protocol on it, and every file that reads one must read those three fields rather than inferring settlement.",
  "defect_location": {
    "repo": "react",
    "summary": "The contract is owned and tightened in react. react/packages/shared/ReactTypes.js:134-151 declares the union - `FulfilledThenable { status:'fulfilled'; value:T }`, `RejectedThenable { status:'rejected'; reason:mixed }`, and `Thenable = UntrackedThenable | PendingThenable | WeakPendingThenable | FulfilledThenable | RejectedThenable` - and is the file every other React package binds to (the `types` lens from it returns the whole adapter family). Enforcement sits in react/packages/react-reconciler/src/ReactFiberThenable.js:125-129 (`trackUsedThenable`, which returns the fulfilled value, throws the rejected `reason`, or throws SuspenseException while instrumenting pending thenables with status expandos) and is duplicated for the two server renderers at react/packages/react-server/src/ReactFizzThenable.js:44-152 and react/packages/react-server/src/ReactFlightThenable.js:47-121; react/packages/react-server/src/ReactFizzHooks.js carries the invariant verbatim - 'If thenable is pending (status pending), throws the thenable to suspend'. The stamping sites that must follow are the five sibling bundler adapters, which share no import edge with each other: react/packages/react-server-dom-esm/src/client/ReactFlightClientConfigBundlerESM.js:83-111 (`preloadModule` caches the import thenable and augments it with status/value/reason) and its Webpack, Turbopack, unbundled-Node and FB twins. Outside react, four repositories independently mint or shim such values and must be brought in line. query/packages/query-core/src/thenable.ts:12-19,53 re-declares React's shape (`Fulfilled { status:'fulfilled'; value:T }`, `Rejected { status:'rejected'; reason:unknown }`) and `pendingThenable()` writes `thenable.status = 'pending'`; that thenable is minted and handed out by query/packages/query-core/src/queryObserver.ts ('this.#currentThenable is a pending thenable after construction') and query/packages/query-core/src/retryer.ts, and reaches render through query/packages/react-query/src/useBaseQuery.ts and its sibling query/packages/preact-query/src/useBaseQuery.ts. jotai/src/react/useAtomValue.ts:11-53,196-204 both stamps and shims: `attachPromiseStatus` writes status/value/reason onto the atom promise, and the local `use` fallback throws the promise when `status === 'pending'`; the promise it stamps is built by jotai/src/vanilla/internals.ts, which stores a pending PromiseLike as the atom value. router/packages/router-core/src/defer.ts declares `DeferredPromiseState` with status 'pending' | 'success' | 'error' and `data`/`error` - a different spelling of the same protocol - and router/packages/react-router/src/awaited.tsx, packages/solid-router/src/awaited.tsx and packages/vue-router/src/awaited.tsx each throw that deferred promise to suspend; router/packages/react-router/src/utils.ts exports the `reactUse` shim that awaited.tsx and lazyRouteComponent.tsx route through, router/packages/react-router/src/Match.tsx throws a transaction promise-like to suspend, and router/packages/react-start-rsc/src/createServerComponentFromStream.ts and SlotContext.tsx pass a stream promise straight to React's `use`. db/packages/react-db/src/useLiveSuspenseQuery.ts suspends on a readiness promise produced by db/packages/db/src/deferred.ts and the collection subscribers, none of which carry the protocol on the promise object."
  },
  "case_id": "xrepo-v5-7-pending-value-protocol-medium",
